{{!< default}}

{{!-- THE SPECIMEN SHEET, ported from the design's own styleguide.

Ghost resolves a page as page-{slug}.hbs first, so the Page slugged `design-tokens` gets this
template and no admin step — the same resolution the five standing Pages already rely on.

WHY THIS IS NOT /styleguide/. It was, for one ticket. The design's sheet has seven sections and
only the last of them is editor content: colour swatches, a labelled type scale, a spacing ramp,
the nav bar and a post card are the THEME'S own tokens and partials, and nothing an author can type
in Ghost admin produces them. That makes this sheet the right thing to score against the drawing
and the wrong thing to call a style guide — a buyer opening "Style guide" wants to know what their
editor can emit and what it will look like, which is a Page of Platform cards and lives at
/styleguide/ (see page-styleguide.hbs). So the two jobs got two Surfaces: the drawing's specimen
sheet is published here, still scored against `01-styleguide-variantA-*.png`, and §07 stays
`{{content}}` so the cards a reader sees below are real editor nodes rather than markup this file
invented.

WHERE THE VALUES COME FROM. Every colour, size, radius and shadow is a token — the swatch chips
paint from `var(--mirror-*)` and the specimens are set with the same utilities the reference build
uses, so this sheet cannot drift from `src/styles/main.css` without src/ changing first. Three
things are read from the publication instead, because on Ghost they belong to the buyer and not to
the drawing: the accent's hex is `{{@site.accent_color}}`, the four font names are resolved from
the cascade by the inline script at the foot (a buyer can pick a heading and body font in admin,
and a hardcoded "Newsreader" would be a lie the moment they do), and the nav bar is the real menu.

THE HEX CAPTIONS ARE LITERAL, and that is the reference build's own decision, not a shortcut: a hex
string here is content — the value being documented — rather than a colour that could be
re-derived, so `src/components/styleguide/SwatchCard.astro` states both and swaps them by Mode.
This file states the same pairs, with the accent's replaced by the publication's own.

THE SPECIMEN LABELS DO NOT GO THROUGH {{t}}. `--surface-2`, `display · 66px` and "Long-form copy
sits at this size" are specimen text in the sense the glossary gives Demo content: the words are
the thing being demonstrated. Chrome on this page — the bar, the foot, the skip link — is partials,
and every string in those is translated as usual.

The page container is 1240px rather than the theme's 1320px. That is the drawing's own width for
this sheet and only this sheet, which is the case `--container-max` exists to serve (see the note
in assets/css/screen.css). --}}

{{> "chrome/header"}}

<main id="main" class="grow">
	{{#post}}
		<article
			class="{{post_class}} container pb-35"
			data-surface="page-design-tokens"
			style="--container-max: 1240px">

			{{!-- ── The masthead ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
			The h1 is the Page's own title and the lede its excerpt, the way every standing Page
			in this theme reads its own copy. The eyebrow names the shipped direction, which is a
			property of the theme rather than of the publication. --}}
			<section class="border-border border-b pt-22 pb-16">
				<p class="text-accent mb-6 font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.1em] uppercase">Variant A — Editorial</p>

				{{!-- Steps down to the h1 size on phones: 66px overflows a 320px screen. --}}
				<h1
					class="font-display text-h1 tracking-display sm:text-display max-w-[22ch] leading-[1.04] font-medium">{{title}}</h1>

				{{#if excerpt}}
					<p class="text-lead text-muted mt-7 max-w-[62ch] leading-[1.55] text-pretty">{{excerpt}}</p>
				{{/if}}

				<dl
					class="border-border bg-border mt-12 grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(180px,100%),1fr))] gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-md border">
					<div class="bg-surface px-5 py-[18px]">
						<dt class="text-muted font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase">Display</dt>
						<dd
							class="font-display mt-1.5 ml-0 text-[17px]"
							data-family></dd>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-surface px-5 py-[18px]">
						<dt class="text-muted font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase">Body</dt>
						<dd
							class="font-body mt-1.5 ml-0 text-[17px]"
							data-family></dd>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-surface px-5 py-[18px]">
						<dt class="text-muted font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase">UI / meta</dt>
						<dd
							class="font-ui mt-1.5 ml-0 text-[17px]"
							data-family></dd>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-surface px-5 py-[18px]">
						<dt class="text-muted font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase">Mono</dt>
						<dd
							class="mt-1.5 ml-0 font-mono text-[15px]"
							data-family></dd>
					</div>
				</dl>
			</section>

			{{!-- ── 01 — Color tokens ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
			The chip paints from the live variable, so it follows the Mode and the buyer's accent
			with no second source. Only the caption is a string. --}}
			<section class="pt-18">
				<h2 class="font-ui text-muted mb-8 text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase">01 — Color tokens</h2>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(min(184px,100%),1fr))] gap-4">
					<div class="border-border bg-surface overflow-hidden rounded-md border">
						<div
							class="border-border h-22 border-b"
							style="background: var(--mirror-bg)"></div>
						<div class="px-3.5 py-3">
							<p class="font-mono text-xs">--bg</p>
							<p class="text-muted mt-[5px] font-mono text-[11px]">
								<span class="dark:hidden">#FAF9F7</span>
								<span class="hidden dark:inline">#12100E</span>
							</p>
							<p class="font-ui text-muted mt-2 text-[11px]">page canvas</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="border-border bg-surface overflow-hidden rounded-md border">
						<div
							class="border-border h-22 border-b"
							style="background: var(--mirror-surface)"></div>
						<div class="px-3.5 py-3">
							<p class="font-mono text-xs">--surface</p>
							<p class="text-muted mt-[5px] font-mono text-[11px]">
								<span class="dark:hidden">#FFFFFF</span>
								<span class="hidden dark:inline">#1B1815</span>
							</p>
							<p class="font-ui text-muted mt-2 text-[11px]">cards, header</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="border-border bg-surface overflow-hidden rounded-md border">
						<div
							class="border-border h-22 border-b"
							style="background: var(--mirror-surface-2)"></div>
						<div class="px-3.5 py-3">
							<p class="font-mono text-xs">--surface-2</p>
							<p class="text-muted mt-[5px] font-mono text-[11px]">
								<span class="dark:hidden">#F3F1ED</span>
								<span class="hidden dark:inline">#231F1B</span>
							</p>
							<p class="font-ui text-muted mt-2 text-[11px]">subtle fills</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="border-border bg-surface overflow-hidden rounded-md border">
						<div
							class="border-border h-22 border-b"
							style="background: var(--mirror-text)"></div>
						<div class="px-3.5 py-3">
							<p class="font-mono text-xs">--text</p>
							<p class="text-muted mt-[5px] font-mono text-[11px]">
								<span class="dark:hidden">#1C1917</span>
								<span class="hidden dark:inline">#F5F2EC</span>
							</p>
							<p class="font-ui text-muted mt-2 text-[11px]">body + headings</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="border-border bg-surface overflow-hidden rounded-md border">
						<div
							class="border-border h-22 border-b"
							style="background: var(--mirror-muted)"></div>
						<div class="px-3.5 py-3">
							<p class="font-mono text-xs">--muted</p>
							<p class="text-muted mt-[5px] font-mono text-[11px]">
								<span class="dark:hidden">#6B625C</span>
								<span class="hidden dark:inline">#A8A09A</span>
							</p>
							<p class="font-ui text-muted mt-2 text-[11px]">meta, captions</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="border-border bg-surface overflow-hidden rounded-md border">
						<div
							class="border-border h-22 border-b"
							style="background: var(--mirror-border)"></div>
						<div class="px-3.5 py-3">
							<p class="font-mono text-xs">--border</p>
							<p class="text-muted mt-[5px] font-mono text-[11px]">
								<span class="dark:hidden">#E4E0D9</span>
								<span class="hidden dark:inline">#302B26</span>
							</p>
							<p class="font-ui text-muted mt-2 text-[11px]">hairlines</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					{{!-- The one swatch whose value is the publication's rather than the drawing's:
					`default.hbs` publishes `{{@site.accent_color}}` into `--mirror-accent`, so the
					caption prints what the buyer chose in admin. One value, both Modes, because
					that inline `:root` is what the cascade resolves in either. --}}
					<div class="border-border bg-surface overflow-hidden rounded-md border">
						<div
							class="border-border h-22 border-b"
							style="background: var(--mirror-accent)"></div>
						<div class="px-3.5 py-3">
							<p class="font-mono text-xs">--accent</p>
							<p class="text-muted mt-[5px] font-mono text-[11px]">{{@site.accent_color}}</p>
							<p class="font-ui text-muted mt-2 text-[11px]">links, CTA</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="border-border bg-surface overflow-hidden rounded-md border">
						<div
							class="border-border h-22 border-b"
							style="background: var(--mirror-accent-soft)"></div>
						<div class="px-3.5 py-3">
							<p class="font-mono text-xs">--accent-soft</p>
							<p class="text-muted mt-[5px] font-mono text-[11px]">
								<span class="dark:hidden">mixed from the accent</span>
								<span class="hidden dark:inline">mixed from the accent</span>
							</p>
							<p class="font-ui text-muted mt-2 text-[11px]">tinted blocks</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<p class="text-muted mt-5 font-mono text-xs">
					Every pair above meets WCAG 2.2 AA — body text ≥ 7:1, muted text ≥ 4.6:1, accent-on-bg ≥ 4.5:1, in both
					modes.
				</p>
			</section>

			{{!-- ── 02 — Type scale ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
			Each row is the token doing its own job. Stacks below `sm`, where a 140px label column
			leaves nothing for the specimen. --}}
			<section class="pt-18">
				<h2 class="font-ui text-muted mb-8 text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase">02 — Type scale</h2>

				<div class="border-border bg-surface overflow-hidden rounded-md border">
					<div
						class="border-border grid grid-cols-1 items-baseline gap-2 border-b px-5 py-[22px] sm:grid-cols-[140px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-6 sm:px-6">
						<span class="text-muted font-mono text-[11px]">display · 66px</span>
						<span class="font-display text-display tracking-display leading-[1.05] font-medium">Reflect the writing</span>
					</div>

					<div
						class="border-border grid grid-cols-1 items-baseline gap-2 border-b px-5 py-[22px] sm:grid-cols-[140px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-6 sm:px-6">
						<span class="text-muted font-mono text-[11px]">h1 · 46px</span>
						<span class="font-display text-h1 tracking-display leading-[1.1] font-medium">A theme for serious publishers</span>
					</div>

					<div
						class="border-border grid grid-cols-1 items-baseline gap-2 border-b px-5 py-[22px] sm:grid-cols-[140px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-6 sm:px-6">
						<span class="text-muted font-mono text-[11px]">h2 · 33px</span>
						<span class="font-display text-h2 tracking-heading leading-[1.2] font-medium">Section heading</span>
					</div>

					<div
						class="border-border grid grid-cols-1 items-baseline gap-2 border-b px-5 py-[22px] sm:grid-cols-[140px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-6 sm:px-6">
						<span class="text-muted font-mono text-[11px]">h3 · 25px</span>
						<span class="font-display text-h3 leading-[1.28] font-medium">Subsection heading</span>
					</div>

					<div
						class="border-border grid grid-cols-1 items-baseline gap-2 border-b px-5 py-[22px] sm:grid-cols-[140px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-6 sm:px-6">
						<span class="text-muted font-mono text-[11px]">h4 · 19px</span>
						<span class="font-ui text-h4 leading-[1.35] font-semibold">Minor heading</span>
					</div>

					<div
						class="border-border grid grid-cols-1 items-baseline gap-2 border-b px-5 py-[22px] sm:grid-cols-[140px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-6 sm:px-6">
						<span class="text-muted font-mono text-[11px]">body · 19px</span>
						<span class="text-body leading-body">
							Long-form copy sits at this size and rides a 68ch measure for comfortable reading.
						</span>
					</div>

					<div
						class="border-border grid grid-cols-1 items-baseline gap-2 border-b px-5 py-[22px] sm:grid-cols-[140px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-6 sm:px-6">
						<span class="text-muted font-mono text-[11px]">small · 16px</span>
						<span class="font-ui text-small text-muted leading-[1.5]">Captions, form help, footer links</span>
					</div>

					<div
						class="grid grid-cols-1 items-baseline gap-2 px-5 py-[22px] sm:grid-cols-[140px_minmax(0,1fr)] sm:gap-6 sm:px-6">
						<span class="text-muted font-mono text-[11px]">meta · 12.5px</span>
						<span class="font-meta text-meta tracking-meta text-muted uppercase">Author · 12 Mar 2026 · 7 min read</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			{{!-- ── 03 — Spacing, radius, shadow ─────────────────────────────────────────────
			The bars carry an inline width because the width IS the specimen: 24px has to be 24px
			whatever the utility scale says. Radius and elevation are the theme's own utilities, so
			what renders is what every card on every Surface gets. --}}
			<section class="pt-18">
				<h2 class="font-ui text-muted mb-8 text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase">
					03 — Spacing, radius, shadow
				</h2>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(280px,100%),1fr))] gap-4">
					<div class="border-border bg-surface rounded-md border p-6">
						<p class="text-muted mb-[18px] font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase">Spacing · 4px base</p>
						<div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
								<span class="text-muted w-[38px] font-mono text-[11px]">4</span>
								<span
									class="bg-accent h-2.5"
									style="width: 4px"></span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
								<span class="text-muted w-[38px] font-mono text-[11px]">8</span>
								<span
									class="bg-accent h-2.5"
									style="width: 8px"></span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
								<span class="text-muted w-[38px] font-mono text-[11px]">12</span>
								<span
									class="bg-accent h-2.5"
									style="width: 12px"></span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
								<span class="text-muted w-[38px] font-mono text-[11px]">16</span>
								<span
									class="bg-accent h-2.5"
									style="width: 16px"></span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
								<span class="text-muted w-[38px] font-mono text-[11px]">24</span>
								<span
									class="bg-accent h-2.5"
									style="width: 24px"></span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
								<span class="text-muted w-[38px] font-mono text-[11px]">32</span>
								<span
									class="bg-accent h-2.5"
									style="width: 32px"></span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
								<span class="text-muted w-[38px] font-mono text-[11px]">48</span>
								<span
									class="bg-accent h-2.5"
									style="width: 48px"></span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
								<span class="text-muted w-[38px] font-mono text-[11px]">72</span>
								<span
									class="bg-accent h-2.5"
									style="width: 72px"></span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
								<span class="text-muted w-[38px] font-mono text-[11px]">112</span>
								<span
									class="bg-accent h-2.5"
									style="width: 112px"></span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="border-border bg-surface rounded-md border p-6">
						<p class="text-muted mb-[18px] font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase">Radius · 6 / 10 / 18</p>
						<div class="flex flex-wrap items-end gap-3.5">
							<div>
								<div class="border-border bg-surface-2 h-16 w-16 rounded-sm border"></div>
								<p class="text-muted mt-2 font-mono text-[11px]">sm</p>
							</div>
