			{{!-- ── 04 — Buttons, tags, forms ────────────────────────────────────────────────
			Every control here is the class list a real one carries: the Subscribe in the bar above
			is the same `btn btn-primary`, and the pills are `tag-pill`'s two states drawn as the
			archives draw them. The input is inert on purpose — it has no `data-members-*`, so
			Portal never binds it and a visitor cannot post a specimen. --}}
			<section class="pt-18">
				<h2 class="font-ui text-muted mb-8 text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase">
					04 — Buttons, tags, forms
				</h2>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(300px,100%),1fr))] gap-4">
